  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A lot of people are starting to use Tomcat 6 now, esp. with OSGi.. we need to move to Tomcat 6 as the default/tested bundled servlet container for Fedora.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Doing this will probably involve switching some lib dependencies.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
